All charts provided here are to be used as an entry-point into a genre, allowing you to gain a basic understanding of what a genre could have to offer. It is recommended that you explore genres on your own after having listened through some of the recommended music. Help with exploring music can be found at the [[Discovering Music]] page. 
Remember that being your own special little snowflake is an encouraged behavior, and you should show this by flaunting your chart and [[last.fm]] in peoples faces, filled with music by obscure EAI, Onkyo and field recording artists from countries that you can't even pronounce.

You can download (nearly) all essential charts from <s>[https://mega.nz/#!M1Qn2TYB!jhZrtg0WhHRVEL9QiZWZTWShO32YK5OfviWxXfuCObE here]</s> (now a dead link).

You can access all Spotify playlists of the charts [[Spotify_Playlists|Spotify Playlists]] here.

